Attribution

The fee collection, claim and pool-binding machinery in src/BossHook.sol is
adapted from launch-784 (the WIN "last buyer wins" hook,
https://github.com/identity-md-launches/launch-784-custom-token-last-buyer),
and src/HookFlags.sol is taken from it unchanged. launch-784 is released under
the MIT License (SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT).

Third-party code vendored under lib/ (forge-std, solmate, Uniswap v4-core) is
not covered by this license. Each file keeps the license named in its
SPDX-License-Identifier header and in the license files of its directory
(lib/forge-std/LICENSE-MIT, lib/forge-std/LICENSE-APACHE, lib/solmate/LICENSE,
lib/v4-core/licenses/).
